OUTPOSTS
   Around two dozen resources extraction, scientific, and military outposts have been built on the planet with most being clustered in the region of Themyscira. These outposts are generally less than 0.5 sq kilometers in area, are surrounded by 10m tall concrete walls with a 10m buffer zone on the exterior, and have 20-100 people working there full time. normally these outposts consist of a dozen buildings for housing and facilities, centered around a vertical mooring spar for airship docking and a small airfield & motorpool. Five heavy-lift airships travel to various outposts in the region around once per week to drop off and pick up resources, supplies, and personnel. For the long distance research & military outposts the colony relies on long-range aircraft & sub-orbital small-ships.
